    "detailed_description": "<strong>Abandoned Hut is a horror/suspense game that tells the story of two brothers heading to their hometown.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>The game is a first-person walking simulator with exploration, driving and dialogue mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brief summary</h2>After a brief rest and some interesting conversations, tiredness takes over, you hand over the steering wheel to your brother. The way back, however, holds an unexpected surprise. The car breaks down in an isolated spot, and the only hope for help comes from a cabin in a pitch-black forest.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>* Gameplay with police officer<br>* Dialogues with NPCS<br>* Alternative endings",
